# cargo-fuzz's working state, none of which belongs in the tree:
#   target/    the nightly-only fuzz build (libfuzzer-sys, sanitizer flags)
#   artifacts/ crash reproducers — libFuzzer writes one file per finding here.
#              A finding is turned into a unit test next to the parser it broke
#              (see the regression tests in lsof-backend-linux), which is the
#              form that survives and runs on every push; the raw input does not.
#   corpus/    the accumulating corpus; persisted between nightly runs by the
#              workflow's actions/cache, not by git.
target/
artifacts/
corpus/
